**Migration**

- File: `supabase/migrations/<YYYYMMDDHHMMSS>_add_event_type_to_tournaments.sql`.
- Body:

  ```sql
  -- Add an event_type column to distinguish single-day open-play events from
  -- multi-round tournaments. Additive; existing rows default to 'tournament'.
  --
  -- Rollback:
  --   ALTER TABLE public.tournaments DROP COLUMN IF EXISTS event_type;
  ALTER TABLE public.tournaments
    ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS event_type text NOT NULL DEFAULT 'tournament'
      CHECK (event_type IN ('tournament', 'open_play'));
  ```
