## Quick reference: open-play lifecycle

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    admin[Admin creates Open Play event] -->|event_type=open_play| db[(tournaments row)]
    db --> home{end_date >= now?}
    home -->|yes| homepage[Shows on homepage + /events with Open Play pill]
    home -->|no| hidden[Hidden from homepage + /events]

    homepage --> visitor[Visitor clicks Reserve]
    visitor --> form[Simplified register form: name, contact, liability checkbox]
    form --> api[/api/register branches on event_type]
    api -->|open_play| skipDS[Skip DocuSeal, mint payToken]
    skipDS --> pay[Stripe Checkout]
    pay --> success[/pay/success]

    hidden --> detail[/events/slug still loads]
    detail --> roster[PublicRoster renders paid attendees first L]
```
